div.p:
Having heard the statements by the Minister of State
                    of Cuba, by the Permanent Representative of the United States of America, and by
                    others;

Taking into account the communication addressed by
                    the Secretary General of the OAS to the Secretary General of the United Nations,
                    dated 7 November 1960;

Deeply concerned by the present tensions in the
                    Western Hemisphere which are largely the product of extracontinental
                    intervention;

Noting that the OAS has condemned emphatically the
                    intervention or threat of intervention by extracontinental powers in the affairs
                    of the American Republics;
